---
/**
 * proposal-development-services.astro
 * 
 * Executive Federal Capture & Proposal Development Practice Page
 * Bespoke Implementation per User Instructions:
 * 1. Page Header (Top Center before Image):
 *    - Title: "Proposal Development Services" with continuous radiant color shimmer and soft initial reveal.
 *    - Subtle gradient accent line.
 * 2. Hero Image & Practice Areas Menu:
 *    - Unclipped showcase frame with object-contain and aspect-[2752/1536].
 *    - 5 Other Practice Areas (current practice excluded).
 *    - "Federal Practices" and "Active Practice" headers removed.
 *    - Hover state inherits the selected bluish pill style: deep blue gradient with white text.
 * 3. Narrative & 4 Square Value Cards (Below Section):
 *    - Headline: "With Unity Compass proposal writing expertise, you can increase your win rates and secure the contracts you deserve"
 *      placed directly BEFORE the narrative paragraph in the lower section!
 *    - Narrative paragraph on the left with 10+ YOE and higher win rate highlights.
 *    - 4 Center-aligned square cards in 2x2 grid (icon, title, desc centered, corner labels removed).
 * 4. Section 2 ("How We Deliver"):
 *    - Highly animated top-to-bottom vertical milestone timeline on Light Blue Blueprint canvas.
 *    - Connected by a radiant gradient spine line with opening aperture nodes (01-05) as you scroll into view.
 * 5. Section 3 ("What you get?"):
 *    - Pure White canvas with 4 shuttle cards (bottom-to-top color fill on hover) and scroll reveal animations.
 * 6. Section 4 ("Why UC?"):
 *    - Light Blue Blueprint canvas with 3 symmetrical cards, bring-to-front hover elevation and scroll reveal animations.
 * 7. Section 5 ("Ready to Win Your Next Government Contract?"):
 *    - Pure White canvas CTA section matching user screenshot with deep blue pill button and watermark.
 * 8. Initial Load & Scroll Animations matching Homepage throughout.
 * 9. Alternating backgrounds: White -> Blue -> White -> Blue -> White.
 */
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import WaveDivider from '../components/WaveDivider.astro';

